	(descr "Johanson Technology 2450AT18A0100001E (legacy P/N 2450AT18A100) 2.4 GHz LTCC chip antenna, 3.2 x 1.6 x 1.3 mm. Land pattern per datasheet Doc# 36S0021A Rev 4.0: two 0.8 x 1.6 mm pads, 2.6 mm gap, 4.2 mm overall. Pin 1 = Feed, Pin 2 = NC (must still be soldered for mechanical anchoring). Includes the 6.5 x 6.5 mm ground clearance from EVB 2450AT18A0100001CE1 as keepout zones on F.Cu / In1.Cu / In2.Cu / B.Cu. Corner mount: board edges belong at +X (past the NC end) and -Y. Requires an external series-shunt-series (tee) matching network; EVB values are 1.0 pF / 2.7 nH / 3.9 nH and will differ on your board.")
